# Magmatic Hellkite: the search does not depend on the land having been destroyed. In response to the
# trigger Bot2 animates Creeping Tar Pit and makes it indestructible until end of turn (Revitalizing Repast), so the destroy does
# nothing, yet Bot2, its controller, still searches and puts a Forest onto the battlefield tapped with a stun counter.
# The Tar Pit stays on the battlefield; Bot1 searches nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Magmatic Hellkite
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Creeping Tar Pit
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Revitalizing Repast
Forest
Forest
Forest x10
Forest

